{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10007_01_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:085ad4512fd55ba59f591d0d51b3ff98dd51dd40beb7cc07df2193235b1ad690",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_h:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_h:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23a6f47edee7923cb09580edbda17d033cdfd97ea28678a9e456d321c6d322c3",
      "text": "再次祝贺，演出辛苦了！\n最后甚至盛况空前，连站席都挤满了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_h:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11bf604782b4dd5ce3362ff8df42478e352f3354281884347575ad1e97303cba",
      "text": "这次的演出让我看到了希望。\n这世上确实有人渴望着我的乐声……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_h:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e142f33054cbc25e39a1f42b7b4397e47048d99c163e0bdecefefdd16f21270",
      "text": "对为我们准备了舞台的阁下，\n我想致以由衷的谢意。谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_h:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58d858aa8c281f5b71e733a2f0bbc4f2db122c0932475caac02349c2658f5707",
      "text": "我也想表达感谢呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_h:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45efab1fef3593c0fc7f15fb7a932e76882a28aee7b5fabccbb05783420541c2",
      "text": "丽先生舒展歌唱的身影，\n动人得让我听得入迷。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_h:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7abe6e2ed40d75700d9d1100d16b044299a99a8e9d47d6220e9ccc1a1f549463",
      "text": "我能与丽先生相遇并创造出音乐，\n都是因为你让我成为了偶像。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_h:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c42bab13b889cf2d37b70a9d384e5dfceb59efd49b884c9d0f6b6848eb6e4d13",
      "text": "谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_h:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de6b22b92e6cf7e97fac55f6f4565445eb834fd347abccb8a32b32512e507d04",
      "text": "这次对于Altessimo而言，\n成了一场难以忘怀的演出。但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_h:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe2905d38b18009594087ceadd277137f3067c0b92742650b3a958c178762e63",
      "text": "距离最终目标的顶尖偶像，\n我们恐怕反倒渐行渐远了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_h:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abb685d5e51d81cc3538fe25b5fa26b381a6a7a00ecb365eb3142ff99877c9b3",
      "text": "毕竟原定计划是参加电视节目的。\n打乱了阁下的计划也是不争的事实……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_h:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d492dcee3f20064b26660136bad613133f2d81360e1f9b3d18cede0c4a53eb3",
      "text": "不，丽先生。在舞台上堂堂正正放声歌唱的两位，\n毫无疑问正大步迈向顶尖偶像！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_h:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57205fa3890c554509c1d923042ddac21bc2e128e0ecc92b8a8d66b7b01fcde4",
      "text": "正因如此，Altessimo才又收到了\n这样一份崭新的工作邀约。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10007_01:1_3_10007_01_h:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a3854a62ade0d03f8e07c34b1a0b504114af934f161ceb33c19aa512f53d4de",
      "text": "……？“职场咨询活动”？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
